# NOTE: data/, models/ and results/ ARE committed on purpose.
# They total ~6 MB, and committing them means anyone cloning this can run
# `python app.py` and see the console immediately, instead of waiting ~25
# minutes for the full pipeline to regenerate them. The pipeline is seeded, so
# re-running it reproduces these exact files byte for byte.
